+"""Traditional / etymological rune meanings — Elder Futhark.
+
+Separate, optional layer shown only on request (the 'ℹ️ О руне' button),
+deliberately kept OUT of the main reading flow. The main bot voice is
+psychological/coaching, not mythological — mixing the two registers in
+the same message reads as inconsistent. This module gives the classic
+context to people who explicitly ask for it, without changing the tone
+of readings themselves.
+
+Each entry: element/idea in one line, then 2-3 sentences of traditional
+meaning (Old Norse/Old English source name, common attested associations).
+Deliberately factual and brief — this is reference material, not a reading.
+"""
